  "summary": {
    "title": "Summary",
    "icon": "",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "keepTogether": true,
    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p>Cloud Technical Lead with 8+ years of experience across cloud transformation, pre-sales, solution architecture, and service delivery. Experience spans the full customer journey, from discovery, RFPs, proposals and BoQs through solution design, migration, and managed-services handover. Led the migration of 15,000 email users and 400+ VMs to the cloud, including re-architecture and the application of security and governance standards. Previously managed cloud product portfolios across Public Cloud, DRaaS, Co-location, and FWaaS at Mobily and solutions by stc, and established a Cloud Partnership Program and redefined the Cloud Life Cycle Process at Mobily. Hands-on foundation in IBM Cloud, Kubernetes, Docker, and private cloud, with supporting AI pre-sales experience. Bridges business, architecture, engineering, delivery, and cloud product strategy.</p>"
  },
