          "description": "<ul><li><p>Led the migration of 15,000 email users and 400+ virtual machines from on-premises to the cloud, including system re-architecture and the application of security and governance standards throughout.</p></li><li><p>Designed and delivered a secure cloud file-sharing platform built to serve 15,000 users reliably.</p></li><li><p>Owned cloud delivery end to end - from infrastructure setup to customer handover - covering migrations, professional services, and managed services.</p></li><li><p>Owned RFP responses, writing tailored proposals, defining project scope, and creating detailed Bills of Quantities (BoQs) for cloud, professional services, and managed services.</p></li><li><p>Led customer discovery meetings, solution design, and technical workshops to align needs with the right cloud solutions.</p></li><li><p>Assessed customer AI use cases and their feasibility on cloud platforms to support AI pre-sales.</p></li></ul>",
          "roles": []
        },
