          "description": "<ul><li><p>Managed Mobily's cloud product portfolio - Public Cloud, DRaaS, Co-location, and custom solutions - keeping offerings competitive and well-positioned in the market.</p></li><li><p>Established a Cloud Partnership Program and redefined the Cloud Life Cycle Process, making partner onboarding and service delivery smoother and more consistent.</p></li><li><p>Enabled the sales team to position cloud products effectively and win more deals.</p></li></ul>",
          "roles": []
        },
